  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A solid frame can easily make the difference in a fight, and few are as firm bodied as you are—welded steel bars are hidden throughout your body, making you extraordinarily tough.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Construct type or subtype.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> All of your movement speeds are reduced by -5 ft. and your weight doubles, but you gain a +1 natural armor bonus to AC, +1 racial bonus to CMB and CMD, and treat your Strength attribute as 2 points higher when determining carrying capacity or making a Strength-based ability or skill check (though not when making attack rolls or weapon damage rolls).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/racial-feats#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
